WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.762
A pivot table summarizes numeric values across two categorical dimensions.

00:00:05.762 --> 00:00:14.932
Here region becomes the row index, channel becomes the columns, and amount is the value being summed.

00:00:14.932 --> 00:00:20.881
Fill_value zero makes missing combinations display as zero instead of NaN.

00:00:21.589 --> 00:00:28.361
This is useful when you want a compact matrix-like report, such as sales by region and channel.

00:00:28.361 --> 00:00:34.976
Before running the code, identify which region-channel combinations appear in the raw data and predict where their

00:00:34.976 --> 00:00:37.472
totals should land.
